{"strongs": "H0774", "word": "אַרְפַּד", "translit": "ar.pad", "root": "ארן", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "city in northern Syria", "definition": "אַרְפַּד proper name, of a location city in northern Syria (Assyrian Arpadda Dl Pa 275 ) — ׳ א Isa 10:9 elsewhere אַרְפָּ֑ד ; approximately 15 miles north of Aleppo, modern Tel Erfâd ; in OT only as conquered by Assyria, always named with Hamath, etc. 2Kgs 18:34 ; 2Kgs 19:13 = Isa 36:19 ; Isa 37:13 (on ᵐ5 Ῥαφέθ = Ἀρφάθ compare Lag BN 78 ), also Isa 10:9 ; Jer 49:23 (compare Nö ZMG 1871, 258 Kiep ib. 655. )", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB778')\">BDB778</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H774')\">H774</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB777')\">BDB777</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB779')\">BDB779</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אַרְפַּד</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> <highlightword>city in northern Syria</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>Arpadda</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Pa 275</sup></lookup>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,9)\">Isa 10:9</ref> elsewhere <bdbheb>אַרְפָּ֑ד</bdbheb>; approximately 15 miles north of Aleppo, modern <highlight>Tel Erfâd</highlight>; in OT only as conquered by Assyria, always named with Hamath, etc. <ref ref=\"2Kgs 18:34\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(12,18,34)\">2Kgs 18:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 19:13\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(12,19,13)\">2Kgs 19:13</ref> = <ref ref=\"Isa 36:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,36,19)\">Isa 36:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 37:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,37,13)\">Isa 37:13</ref> (on <lookup onc